e ratios\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Changes in obesity prevalence were considered statistically significant if the 95% confidence intervals for differences in adjusted prevalence did not include zero.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Statistically significant increase based on log binomial regression model adjusted for age, sex, and race/ethnicity.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}